{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Hello! Welcome to Nimbus Telecom. I'm Sana. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Sana, I'm seeing a weird charge on my bill this month. It's like 20 bucks more than usual. I'm really annoyed by this.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I need your account number to look into this.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "It's 41433295. My name is Vivek Brown.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I see the charge. It was for a premium data package that was added to your account.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "What?? I never signed up for that! This is ridiculous. Why is this happening?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will raise a refund request for the wrong charge now.",
    "tags": ["action:refund_request"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "So you're just going to fix it? I want to make sure this doesn't happen again. Can you guarantee it?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "The refund is subject to approval and will take 7-10 business days to process.",
    "tags": ["disclosure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Wait, you didn't even answer my question. I'm so tired of these mistakes. This is terrible service!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Is there anything else I can help you with? I have raised the request and the refund will be processed if approved. Goodbye.",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I'm still angry! This is a joke of a company. 😡",
    "tags": []
  }
]}
